.cache/
.claude/
.pio/
.venv/
.venv-*/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# Anchored to the repo root — an unanchored "build*" also swallows files like
# docs/reference/build-environments.md and .github/workflows/build.yml.
/build*
# ...but /build* swallows the root build script too, and that one IS tracked:
# it is the only entry point that assembles the IDF 5.5.5 environment correctly
# (see its header comment) and it is referenced by the partition CSV and the S3
# board defaults. Without this line `git add .` silently drops it.
!/build_fw.py

# Pre-work full-project snapshots + flashable image sets, one folder per session.
# Hundreds of MB and it carries the real AP credential — never publish it.
/firmware_backup/

# 个人工程日志（私人笔记，里面常有 SSID/IP/MAC/绝对路径）—— 不发布。
/项目完整总结.md

# Documentation site output
/site/

# Local tooling artifacts (screenshots, browser traces)
/output/
managed_components/
# Generated by ESP-IDF / PlatformIO. Anchored to the root so they cannot shadow
# the tracked board defaults in config/.
/sdkconfig
/sdkconfig.*

# Local per-board overrides — see docs/boards/custom.md
config/sdkconfig.user.*

user_platformio.ini

# macOS metadata
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
